"AIShortcut.EditorController.StepsHelp" = "Steps run from top to bottom, one per line. A line starting with # is a note.\n\n**Get data** · instant, no AI\n**run:** action {json} · a Telegram action, e.g. run: unread_count\n**input:** name | question · asks you for a value\n**set:** name = value · keeps a value\n\n**Use AI**\n**write:** prompt with {{data}} · one quick AI call on that data\n**ask:** prompt · the full agent with every tool, slowest\n\n**Check**\n**confirm:** question · stops unless you agree\n**require:** message · stops when the last result is empty\n\n**Show or send**\n**say:** text · a note in the assistant chat\n**send:** text · sends to this chat, asks first\n\nAdd -> name after run, write or ask to keep the result as {{name}}.\nReady to use: {{chat}}, {{chat_id}}, {{result}}, {{date}}, {{time}}.";
